This verse is Dhammapada 165 in the standard numbering (the Pali text used in most editions, including the Chaṭṭha Saṅgāyana/VRI edition), not 184. Verse 184 is a different verse, the one beginning "Sabbapāpassa akaraṇaṃ..." is actually 183, and 184 is "Khantī paramaṃ tapo titikkhā..."

As for the exact location in the VRI (Chaṭṭha Saṅgāyana) edition: the verse appears in the Dhammapada section of the Khuddakanikāya, in the Pāpavagga (Chapter 12, "Attavagga" in some numbering) of the Dhammapada. In the Chaṭṭha Saṅgāyana edition the verse appears as:

